# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Reference / whitelist files. These are Parse Biosciences barcode sets, the
# ADT panel table and the experiment RT plate layout: licensed or
# experiment-specific inputs that live outside the repo and are named in the
# YAML config instead.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
reference/
bc_data_rt.csv
bc_data_ligation.csv
bc_dict_*.json
adt_barcodes.csv
*_RT_Layout.csv

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Outputs, intermediates, logs. All real runs write outside the repo; these
# patterns are a backstop in case something is ever pointed at the tree.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
outs/
out/
outputs/
results/
runs/
signalseq-runs/
logs/
*.log
figures/
*.png
*.pdf
*.svg
*_qc_stats.json
*_saturation.csv
resolved_config.yaml
provenance.json

